# NotVisuals — file-scoped licensing index

NotVisuals is a **mixed-license project**. This document is an index, not a separate license.

- Original program code, GLSL shaders, Python tools and technical definitions: **GPL-3.0-only**, full text in [LICENSE-CODE](LICENSE-CODE).
- Original artistic assets whose rightsholders have authorized the grant: **CC BY-NC-SA 4.0**, terms linked in [LICENSE-ASSETS.md](LICENSE-ASSETS.md).
- External or unverified material: **no automatic new license grant**; see [THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md](THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md).

See [LICENSING.md](LICENSING.md) for file paths, exceptions, history, and Modrinth details. The overall pack is **not entirely open-source** under the OSI definition because of the NonCommercial artwork license. Code covered by GPLv3 **can be used commercially** subject to that license.

Earlier grants of GPLv3 rights to historical releases remain valid. Branding is addressed separately in [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md).
